If you’ve been streaming on Chaturbate and barely making money — or worse, making nothing at all — it can feel frustrating, confusing, and honestly discouraging.

You see other models making hundreds or even thousands, while you’re sitting there wondering what you’re doing wrong.

Here’s the truth:

Most cam models aren’t failing because of looks, personality, or effort.

